Falsifies `calendar::verification::every_real_date_survives_its_own_day_number`.

The defect: `Civil::to_unix` weights a minute at 61 seconds. The date still round-trips through its day number,
but the timestamp of the last minute of 9999-12-31 lands past `MAX_TIMESTAMP`.

Expected to fail: the harness's `assert!((MIN_TIMESTAMP..=MAX_TIMESTAMP).contains(&secs))`.

